# SPEC-013 — Dashboard
Version: 1.0
Status: Approved
Phase: Sprint 1
Category: Feature Specification

---

# Purpose

The Dashboard is the operational command center of Sonic AI V3.

It is not a collection of widgets.

It is the creator's daily briefing.

Its responsibility is to answer one question:

"What deserves my attention right now?"

Every element on the Dashboard should reduce decision fatigue and increase creative momentum.

---

# User Promise

"When I open Sonic, I immediately understand the state of my creative world."

---

# Primary Question

"What should I work on today?"

---

# Objectives

• Surface active work
• Resume momentum
• Display meaningful progress
• Highlight priorities
• Reduce navigation
• Encourage completion

